# ACP endpoint URLs and Keychain account names live in the machine-local registry.
# Keep gateway bearer values in macOS Keychain (`.agents/acp/acp login`); use
# endpoint-specific environment variables only for controlled automation such as CI.
# Never commit bearer credentials.
# Optional absolute path override for the machine-local registry:
# ACP_ENDPOINT_REGISTRY=/absolute/path/to/acp-endpoints.json
